ms-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary-100 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-800\" aria-hidden=\"true\">?</div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"truncate text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700\"></p><p class=\"truncate text-xs text-neutral-500\">User</p></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-neutral-500 hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:text-neutral-700 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary-600\" aria-label=\"Sign out\"><svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 16l4-4m0 0l-4-4m4 4H7m6 4v1a3 3 0 01-3 3H6a3 3 0 01-3-3V7a3 3 0 013-3h4a3 3 0 013 3v1\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></aside><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pb-20 lg:ml-[260px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-0 px-4 py-3 lg:px-8\"><!--[--><div class=\"h-6\"></div><!--]--></div><div class=\"px-4 py-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><!--[--><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-neutral-0\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-neutral-50\"><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 via-primary-700 to-secondary-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 text-center md:py-28\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-700\"> Momentum Pathways </p><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-neutral-900 md:text-5xl\"> Your GED is just the beginning </h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-700\"> You worked hard to earn your GED. Now find the right college for you. Our free platform helps you explore your options, understand what you need, and connect with colleges ready to support you. </p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"/auth/login\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-lg bg-primary-700 px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-primary-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary-600\"> Get Started </a><a href=\"/auth/login\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-8 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-700 shadow-sm hover:bg-neutral-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary-600\"> Sign In </a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-neutral-0 px-4 py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><h2 class=\"mb-10 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900\"> How it works </h2><nav aria-label=\"Your progress\"><ol class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 lg:hidden\"><!--[--><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>1</span></span><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mt-1 h-6 w-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 pt-1 text-sm\">Complete your GED</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>2</span></span><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mt-1 h-6 w-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 pt-1 text-sm\">Tell us about yourself</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>3</span></span><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mt-1 h-6 w-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 pt-1 text-sm\">Talk with your AI guide</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>4</span></span><!----></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 pt-1 text-sm\">Find your college</span></li><!--]--></ol><ol class=\"hidden items-center lg:flex\"><!--[--><li class=\"flex-1 flex items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>1</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">Complete your GED</span></div><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mx-2 h-0.5 flex-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex-1 flex items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>2</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">Tell us about yourself</span></div><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mx-2 h-0.5 flex-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex-1 flex items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>3</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">Talk with your AI guide</span></div><span class=\"bg-neutral-200 mx-2 h-0.5 flex-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li><li class=\"flex items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"bg-neutral-100 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-300 flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 text-sm\"><span>4</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">Find your college</span></div><!----></li><!--]--></ol></nav><div class=\"mt-8 hidden grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center lg:grid\"><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\"> You earned your GED. That&#39;s a big deal. </p><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\"> A short form about your goals, location, and interests. </p><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\"> A friendly AI advisor helps you think through what&#39;s next. </p><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\"> See colleges that fit your needs and connect directly. </p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><h2 class=\"mb-10 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900\"> What you get </h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6 text-primary-700\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900\"> Discover what&#39;s right for you </h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-neutral-700\"> An AI guide talks with you about your goals, strengths, and what&#39;s standing in your way. No tests, no pressure. </p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-secondary-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6 text-secondary-600\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0 7 7 0 0 1 14 0Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900\"> Find colleges that fit </h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-neutral-700\"> Browse colleges matched to your needs, location, and interests. See what each college offers before you decide. </p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"h-6 w-6 text-primary-700\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900\"> Get support along the way </h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-base text-neutral-700\"> Message colleges directly, track your progress, and stay on course. You are in control of your information. </p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-neutral-0 px-4 py-16 md:py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900\"> For colleges </h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-neutral-700\"> GED completers are an often-invisible population. Momentum Pathways gives your institution early visibility into potential applicants, structured learner profiles, and the chance to provide targeted support before term starts. </p><a href=\"/auth/login\" class=\"mt-8 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-lg border border-primary-700 bg-white px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-primary-700 hover:bg-primary-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-secondary-600\"> College sign in </a></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-4 py-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900\"> Momentum Pathways </p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-neutral-500\"> Bridging GED completion and college enrolment. </p></div></footer>